  "decisions": [
    "Link existing Alliance/shared Feralas quests only; do not add Horde-only or other-class quest markers.",
    "The source marks rare coordinates Classic even when an NPC has been seen in Forever. Do not promote those positions to Forever confirmed.",
    "Only Kristy Grant has a current explicit Forever pickup coordinate; retain that location provenance separately.",
    "Retain exact source coordinates for all shared approximate marker groups, including Shay's quest chest.",
    "Only Shay's quest chest is placed. Rectangle-only treasure candidates fall outside the Feralas terrain or are that known quest object; the checked Era chest layer has no Feralas rows. Absence here is not proof that no chest can spawn in Forever.",
    "Do not map unidentified item-drop locations. Keep external quest starters in their actual zones rather than projecting them into Feralas."
